      },
      {
        "heading": "What does General Atomics sell to the government?",
        "body": "Other Aircraft Parts and Auxiliary Equipment Manufacturing is the largest product market for General Atomics, with $376M in obligations this year to date. Research and Development in the Physical, Engineering, and Life Sciences is the second-largest market at $47M, while Guided Missile and Space Vehicle Manufacturing and Ship Building and Repairing are smaller markets at $5.2M and $5.1M respectively."
      }
